# LF everywhere, in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# The .editorconfig line-ending rule and this file must agree: when they disagreed,
# `dotnet format --verify-no-changes` failed on 1605 ENDOFLINE errors across the whole tree, which
# makes the format gate useless because nobody can ever get it green.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
